From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:02:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 42/43] Non-renderer host libraries link again: stub the
 Controllers window toggle

ryty_stubs.cpp (in every host library) calls Ryty::ToggleControllerOverlay for the settings
hotkey since the in-game Controllers window (86aafa5c), but only libSceVideoOut defines it, so
libSceAjm, Audio3d, DiscMap, Ngs2, NpAuth, ScreenShot and Zlib no longer linked. They get a no-op.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ryty_gpu/ryty_hle_precompile.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ryty_gpu/ryty_hle_precompile.cpp b/ryty_gpu/ryty_hle_precompile.cpp
index 8df29c2c..881a4f70 100644
--- a/ryty_gpu/ryty_hle_precompile.cpp
+++ b/ryty_gpu/ryty_hle_precompile.cpp
@@ -5,3 +5,8 @@ bool PrecompileHoldsGame() {
     return false;
 }
 }
+
+// The in-game Controllers window lives in libSceVideoOut; here the settings hotkey has nothing to open.
+namespace Ryty {
+void ToggleControllerOverlay() {}
+}
